        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that we are well-positioned to leverage over 20 years of research and development to develop and commercialize disruptive aerogel products for a wide array of new markets beyond the energy industrial, sustainable insulation materials, and EV markets.",
